sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor G as Security Guard
    participant UI as Locked-gate kiosk and drawer
    participant Dialog as Elevated confirmation
    participant API as Guard shift and access API
    participant Scope as Role, active shift, assignment, gate, and event checks
    participant Service as Override, escalation, or handover service
    participant Audit as Tenant or site operational audit
    participant DB as Tenant database
    participant Outbox as Gate command or supervisor handoff

    G->>UI: Choose protected action while authoritative data is fresh

    alt Offline, stale, or unreconciled
        UI-->>G: Disable final action and require REST reconciliation
    else Allow once or Deny once
        UI->>Dialog: Show event, plate, status, shift, gate, evidence, action, required reason
        alt Missing reason or evidence acknowledgement
            Dialog-->>G: Inline validation and focus invalid control
        else Valid override confirmation
            Dialog-->>G: Confirm one-time decision
        end
    else Escalate unresolved event
        UI->>Dialog: Show event, source, shift, gate, severity, impact, and required reason
        alt Missing reason
            Dialog-->>G: Inline validation and do not submit
        else Valid escalation confirmation
            Dialog-->>G: Confirm escalation
        end
    else End shift and handover
        UI->>API: Request versioned handover preview
        API-->>UI: Counts, overrides, escalations, unresolved events, preview version
        UI->>Dialog: Show final summary and note rule
        alt Unresolved items without handover note
            Dialog-->>G: Require note and focus input
        else Valid end-shift confirmation
            Dialog-->>G: Confirm end shift
        end
    end

    G->>Dialog: Submit confirmed action
    Dialog->>UI: Lock duplicate submit and show pending state
    UI->>API: Send session, target, reason/evidence, expected version, and Idempotency-Key
    API->>Scope: Verify SECURITY_GUARD, active shift, assigned active site, exact gate, source ownership, eligibility

    alt Scope denied, gate mismatch, disabled site/gate, or resource unavailable
        Scope-->>API: 403, SITE_DISABLED, or non-disclosing 404
        API-->>UI: Generic unavailable result
        UI->>Dialog: Clear executable state or return to shift context
        Dialog-->>G: No cross-site or privileged data disclosure
    else Scope allowed
        Scope-->>API: Permit target action
        API->>Service: Validate current event or preview state

        alt Stale version, already resolved event, duplicate escalation, or stale preview
            Service-->>API: 409 conflict
            API-->>UI: Prior server state remains authoritative
            UI->>Dialog: Preserve safe input and require refresh/review
        else Valid action
            Service->>DB: Persist override, escalation, or shift-handover state
            Service->>Audit: Append actor, shift, site, gate, target, reason, evidence, action, outcome
            Audit->>DB: Write immutable audit in same transaction

            alt Audit write fails
                DB-->>Audit: Audit failure
                Audit-->>Service: Fail transaction
                Service-->>API: Protected action not completed
                API-->>UI: Failure; never claim success
                UI->>Dialog: Restore focus and offer retry
            else Audit written
                DB-->>Audit: Audit and correlation reference
                alt Allow override requires gate command
                    Audit->>Outbox: Enqueue one-time gate command
                    alt Outbox write fails
                        Outbox-->>Service: Fail required transaction
                        Service-->>API: Override not completed
                        API-->>UI: Failure; never say gate opened
                    else Command queued
                        Outbox-->>Service: QUEUED command state
                    end
                else Escalation
                    Audit->>Outbox: Enqueue Site Manager first or Tenant Admin fallback handoff
                    Outbox-->>Service: Escalation handoff state
                else End shift
                    Audit->>Outbox: Finalize server-generated handover result
                    Outbox-->>Service: Handover outcome
                end
                Audit-->>Service: Durable audit outcome
                Service-->>API: Updated event or shift plus audit and correlation reference
                API-->>UI: Confirmed server result
                UI->>UI: Refresh authoritative event, feed, or shift context
                UI-->>G: Inline durable outcome; toast is supplementary only
            end
        end
    end

    Note over G,DB: Browser URL, realtime payload, or local state never grants gate or event authority.
    Note over UI,Outbox: No protected mutation is queued offline or replayed automatically after reconnect or login.
